ong","strong-0",{"children":"HVAC"}]," system last serviced, and is it a gas or electric system?\" (냉난방 공조 시스템은 마지막으로 언제 정비되었으며, 가스 방식인가요 전기 방식인가요?)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"핵심 표현 6: 이웃 및 소음 문제 확인"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"집 자체만큼 중요한 것이 이웃(Neighbors)과 소음 문제(Noise Level)입니다."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"[예문]"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"How is the ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"soundproofing"}]," between this unit and the one next door?\" (이 유닛과 옆집 사이의 방음 상태는 어떻습니까?)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"What is the ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"parking situation"}]," like? Is there a designated spot for this unit?\" (주차 상황은 어떻습니까? 이 유닛을 위한 지정된 주차 공간이 있나요?)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"Are there any known issues regarding ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"traffic noise"}]," during rush hour?\" (러시아워(교통 체증 시간) 동안 교통 소음에 관한 알려진 문제가 있나요?)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-3",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"마무리 및 다음 단계: 명확한 의사 전달"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2025-10-16-real-estate-viewing-english-1-h2-4.jpg","alt":"마무리 및 다음 단계: 명확한 의사 전달